item.description:
Doctor profiles (feature 004, US2–US3). Every active staff member can list and view doctors;
only administrators create and update profiles; `/doctors/me` is for doctors. A profile links
to one staff account with the doctor role, which supplies the name; the doctor is active only
while that account is active and still a doctor. Responses never include the account email,
role, or id. Runs after Specialties (uses `specialty_id`). Contract:
`specs/004-doctors-specialties/contracts/doctors.openapi.yaml`.
